# Signing key material must never enter this repository. The private half of the
# Agent Card signing key lives at ~/.config/a2atraffic/signing-key.jwk, mode
# 0600, outside this tree. These patterns are a backstop for a stray copy, not
# the mechanism — the mechanism is that tools/sign-card.mjs writes it outside the
# repo and launch-gate.mjs refuses to publish a JWKS containing a `d` member.
*.jwk
signing-key*
*.pem
*.key
!records/signing-key.public.json
